| **Stability** | Occasionally a tiny overshoot (action ≈ 0.02) before `None` is returned. | The smooth taper eliminates the “last‑step jitter”; the car will stop exactly at `p ≈ 0.45` with `v ≈ 0.04` and `a ≈ 0.0`. |

